full non-interactive suite only pre-existing ParkingPlaceBehavior_ReportLanding; sln format + brace clean. Decision flagged for operator review: tiles-to-world changed 12 -> 18.2505 (gameplay ranges/speeds of imported EE2 units grow ~1.52x) and EE2 weapon ranges now measure 2D ground distance.
