uels 7/7. Full non-interactive suite only pre-existing ParkingPlaceBehavior_ReportLanding; format/brace clean. Operator notes: harness config knob must point at the shipped profile by path (CLI --ValidationGroundEe2ProfilePath is not a bound arg); duel winners reflect per-unit point costs (a 900-point Crusader beating a 795-point EE2 light tank is expected, armies equalize through counts).
2026-10-13 WI-M3-01 rework (PR #238 review): model scale moved from per-frame world-matrix multiply to a one-time install bake. Reviewer: scale belongs at import, setting the asset's dimensions once. Confirmed the old path ran every frame (Drawable.BuildRenderList -> W3dModelDraw.SetWorldMatrix -> ApplyImportedModelScale) while dimensions/bounds never saw the factor. New mechanism: UnitContentImportRunner passes the profile factor to ImportedVisualInstaller(modelScale), ImportedModelMaterializer.MaterializeModel(model, context, rootScale) bakes it into root bone binds (ModelBoneHierarchy scales each root's bind translation + bind scale). Equivalence proof recorded in code comment + test: scaling root binds appends a trailing uniform scale to every bone's absolute chain, identical by associativity to CreateScale * worldMatrix, so rigid meshes, skinned meshes through unchanged inverse binds, animated poses (rest-relative offsets reproduce the scaled rest), shadows, attachments, and part bounds all match the old render output; vertices, child binds, and animation channels stay authored. Removed W3dModelDrawModuleData.ImportedModelScale, W3dModelDraw.ApplyImportedModelScale, and UnitMaterializationContext.GameUnitsPerSourceModelUnit (profile field + CaptureProfileValidator validation unchanged). Tests: Ee2ModelScaleTests no-install folding test replaced by RootBindScaleBakesTheModelScaleIntoEveryBoneChain (synthetic skeleton, cumulative-chain == chain * CreateScale(2) per bone); installed test replaced by InstalledModelsBakeTheAuthoredModelScaleIntoRootBinds (boots Generals, installs one EE2 model through ImportedVisualInstaller, asserts installed root binds scaled / child binds unchanged; class now SerialGameTests after a parallel Game-boot ctor race failed the batch run); MaterializeReferenceRoster helper dropped (single caller was the old draw-scale test). Docs: WI-M3-01 card steps/acceptance/result, mass-battle-1k.md grounding + mermaid, track-m-m3 implementation plan runtime seam.
